+## Secrets / headers — Vercel bypass
+
+If your deployment is protected by a Vercel Deployment Protection bypass (e.g., for staging or preview environments), you must configure the following:
+
+- **Header Name:** `x-vercel-protection-bypass`
+- **Secret/Value:** Found in your Vercel project settings under Deployment Protection.
+- **Implementation:** Ensure your crawler or webhook listener includes this header in all outgoing requests to avoid 401 Unauthorized errors.
